{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}Privacy Policy – {{NAME_SITE}} {% endblock %}
{% block meta_description %}
    Discover the privacy policy of {{NAME_SITE}}. We explain how your personal data is collected, used, and protected in compliance with the GDPR.
{% endblock %}
{% block meta_keywords %}
    privacy policy, personal data, GDPR, data protection, {{NAME_SITE}}, confidentiality, data security
{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
    <main class="professional-loan">
    <section class="hero-section hero-confidentialite text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Your trust is our priority. Discover how we protect your personal data.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12">
                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        The website of <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong> is owned by <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong>, acting as the data controller for your personal data.
                        We have established this Privacy Policy to detail how we process the information collected by <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong>. This policy also explains why we need to collect certain personal data about you. It is therefore essential to carefully read this policy before using the <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong> website.
                        We attach paramount importance to the protection of your personal data and are committed to ensuring its confidentiality and security.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="100">
                    <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-3">1. Personal Information We Collect</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        When you visit <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong>, we automatically collect certain information about your device. This includes details about your web browser, IP address, time zone, and some of the cookies installed on your device. Additionally, as you browse the Site, we collect information about the web pages or products you view, the websites or search terms that referred you to the Site, and how you interact with the Site. We collectively refer to this automatically collected information as "Device Information".
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        Furthermore, we may collect the personal data you voluntarily provide to us (including, but not limited to, your first name, last name, address, payment information, etc.) when you register or use our services, in order to fulfill the service contract we have with you.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="200">
                    <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-3">2. Why Do We Process Your Data?</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        The security of our customers' data is our top priority. Therefore, we only process the minimum user data strictly necessary for the proper functioning of the website. The automatically collected Device Information is used solely to identify potential cases of abuse and to compile anonymous statistics regarding website usage. This statistical information is in no way aggregated to identify a particular user of the system.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        You have the option to browse our website without revealing your identity or providing personal information that specifically identifies you.
                        However, if you wish to use certain features of the website, subscribe to our newsletter, or contact us via a form, you may be asked to provide personal data such as your email address, first name, last name, city of residence, organization, or phone number. You are free not to provide us with this personal data, but this may prevent you from benefiting from certain features of the website, such as receiving our newsletter or direct contact from the site.
                        If you have any doubts about the mandatory information, please do not hesitate to contact us <a href="{{path('contact.form.us')}}" class="text-accent-red">on our contact page</a>.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="300">
                    <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-3">3. Your Data Protection Rights (GDPR)</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        If you are a resident of the European Economic Area (EEA), you have the following rights regarding your personal data, in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR):
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled text-secondary-dark">
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> The right to be informed about the processing of your data.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> The right to access your personal data.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> The right to rectification of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> The right to erasure of your data (right to be forgotten).</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> The right to restriction of processing of your data.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> The right to data portability, to receive your data in a structured and commonly used format.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> The right to object to the processing of your data for legitimate reasons.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> Rights in relation to automated individual decision-making and profiling.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at the email address provided in the "Contact Information" section below.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        Additionally, if you are a European resident, we want to clarify that we process your information either to fulfill contracts we may have with you (for example, if you subscribe to a service via the Site), or to pursue our legitimate business interests described above. Please note that your information may be transferred outside the European Economic Area, including to Canada and the United States, to countries recognized by the EU as providing an adequate level of protection or through standard contractual clauses.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="400">
                    <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-3">4. Links to Other Websites</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        Our website may contain links to other websites that are not owned or controlled by us. We want to emphasize that we are not responsible for the privacy of these other websites or the privacy practices of third parties. We encourage you to be vigilant when you leave our website and to read the privacy statements of each website that may collect personal information.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="500">
                    <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-3">5. Information Security</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        We secure the information you provide on computer servers in a controlled and secure environment, protected from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure. We implement reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect against unauthorized access, use, modification, and disclosure of personal data under our control and custody. However, no data transmission over the Internet or wireless network can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="600">
                    <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-3">6. Legal Disclosure</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        We may disclose any information we collect, use, or receive if required or permitted by law, for example, to comply with a subpoena, similar legal process, or when we believe in good faith that disclosure is necessary to protect our rights, your safety or the safety of others, investigate fraud, or respond to a government request.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="700">
                    <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-3">7. Contact Information</h2>
                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        For any questions regarding this privacy policy,
                        or if you wish to exercise your rights related to your personal information,
                        you can contact us by email by filling out the form <a href="{{path('contact.form.us')}}" class="text-accent-red">on the contact page</a>.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

    </main>
{% endblock %}